# GBIF-derived hotspot data and its GeoNames-derived place-search sibling —
# large (hotspots_seasonal.bolt: low single-digit GB; places.bolt: tens of MB),
# rebuilt by cmd/gensnapshot hotspots/places, never committed: scp'd
# directly to the serving host instead. See ARCHITECTURE.md. Unlike these,
# data/taxonomy_*.json.gz stays small and IS committed (go:embed'd into the
# binary) — don't broaden this pattern to /data/ wholesale.
/data/hotspots.bolt
/data/hotspots_seasonal.bolt
/data/places.bolt
